{"id":"c4aaed843fab5b1c","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-bdd.md","title":"Binary decision diagrams and their evaluation","display":"df-bdd — Binary decision diagrams and their evaluation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-bdd","aliases":["27-df-bdd"],"display":"df-bdd — Binary decision diagrams and their evaluation","depends_on":["[[27-df-nat]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§1.12.3","source_printed_pages":"46,47","source_pdf_pages":"70,71","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-bdd"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-bdd</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bdd — Binary decision diagrams and their evaluation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d87d01e5686c19fe\" href=\"?note=d87d01e5686c19fe\" title=\"27-df-nat\">27-df-nat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.12.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"46,47"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"70,71"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为非空有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq V\">\\(I\\subseteq V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in V\">\\(r\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0,s_1:I\\to V\">\\(s_0,s_1:I\\to V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda:I\\to[n]\">\\(\\lambda:I\\to[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:V\\setminus I\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(\\tau:V\\setminus I\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq V^2\">\\(A\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^+\\subseteq V^2\">\\(A^+\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 为下式构造的边关系及正长度可达关系；有限路径序列明确以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,k\">\\(0,\\ldots,k\\)</span> 编号。元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)\">\\(G=(V,I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)\\)</span> 作为结构参数。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota e\">\\(\\iota e\\)</span> 表示满足指定条件的唯一对象，仅在已证存在唯一的输入上使用。 下节引入结构谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)\\)</span> 和仅在该谓词成立时有定义的求值构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\coloneqq\\{(v,s_b(v))\\mid v\\in I,b\\in\\mathbb B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\coloneqq\\{(v,s_b(v))\\mid v\\in I,b\\in\\mathbb B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A^+\\coloneqq\\{(u,w)\\in V^2\\mid\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists v\\in V^{\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}}\\;(v_0=u\\land v_k=w\\land\\forall t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\;(v_t,v_{t+1})\\in A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A^+\\coloneqq\\{(u,w)\\in V^2\\mid\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists v\\in V^{\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}}\\;(v_0=u\\land v_k=w\\land\\forall t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\;(v_t,v_{t+1})\\in A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(\\forall v\\in I\\;s_0(v)\\ne s_1(v))\\land(\\forall v\\in V\\;(v,v)\\notin A^+)\\land\\{v\\in V\\mid\\nexists u\\in V\\;(u,v)\\in A\\}=\\{r\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(\\forall v\\in I\\;s_0(v)\\ne s_1(v))\\land(\\forall v\\in V\\;(v,v)\\notin A^+)\\land\\{v\\in V\\mid\\nexists u\\in V\\;(u,v)\\in A\\}=\\{r\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)\\Rightarrow\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\exists!e:V\\to\\mathbb B\\;\\left(\\forall v\\in V\\setminus I\\;e(v)=\\tau(v)\\;\\land\\;\\forall v\\in I\\;e(v)=e(s_{a_{\\lambda(v)}}(v))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)\\Rightarrow\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\exists!e:V\\to\\mathbb B\\;\\left(\\forall v\\in V\\setminus I\\;e(v)=\\tau(v)\\;\\land\\;\\forall v\\in I\\;e(v)=e(s_{a_{\\lambda(v)}}(v))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_{G,a}\\coloneqq\\iota e\\in\\mathbb B^V\\;\\left(\\forall v\\in V\\setminus I\\;e(v)=\\tau(v)\\;\\land\\;\\forall v\\in I\\;e(v)=e(s_{a_{\\lambda(v)}}(v))\\right)\\qquad(\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G),\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_{G,a}\\coloneqq\\iota e\\in\\mathbb B^V\\;\\left(\\forall v\\in V\\setminus I\\;e(v)=\\tau(v)\\;\\land\\;\\forall v\\in I\\;e(v)=e(s_{a_{\\lambda(v)}}(v))\\right)\\qquad(\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G),\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)(a)\\coloneqq e_{G,a}(r)\\qquad(\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G),\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)(a)\\coloneqq e_{G,a}(r)\\qquad(\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G),\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书把边标为 0 或 1；这里用两个后继函数编码边标签，内部节点的变量标签与叶子的输出标签分开。有限无环性允许从叶子反向递归，故每个输入确定唯一状态函数；唯一源点使全部节点从根可达。一般 BDD 允许在一路径上重复测试同一变量，不能把子节点函数直接当成互补余因子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-nat","status":"resolved","id":"d87d01e5686c19fe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-nat]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"s_0,s_1:I\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda:I\\to[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:V\\setminus I\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"A^+\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,k","display":false},{"tex":"G=(V,I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\coloneqq\\{(v,s_b(v))\\mid v\\in I,b\\in\\mathbb B\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"A^+\\coloneqq\\{(u,w)\\in V^2\\mid\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\exists v\\in V^{\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}}\\;(v_0=u\\land v_k=w\\land\\forall t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\;(v_t,v_{t+1})\\in A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(\\forall v\\in I\\;s_0(v)\\ne s_1(v))\\land(\\forall v\\in V\\;(v,v)\\notin A^+)\\land\\{v\\in V\\mid\\nexists u\\in V\\;(u,v)\\in A\\}=\\{r\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)\\Rightarrow\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\exists!e:V\\to\\mathbb B\\;\\left(\\forall v\\in V\\setminus I\\;e(v)=\\tau(v)\\;\\land\\;\\forall v\\in I\\;e(v)=e(s_{a_{\\lambda(v)}}(v))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"e_{G,a}\\coloneqq\\iota e\\in\\mathbb B^V\\;\\left(\\forall v\\in V\\setminus I\\;e(v)=\\tau(v)\\;\\land\\;\\forall v\\in I\\;e(v)=e(s_{a_{\\lambda(v)}}(v))\\right)\\qquad(\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G),\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)(a)\\coloneqq e_{G,a}(r)\\qquad(\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G),\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true}],"bytes":2742,"backlinks":[{"id":"23deb51a65e1127c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N^+$。$V$ 为非空有限集，$I\\subseteq V$，$r\\in V$，$s_0,s_1:I\\to V$，$\\lambda:I\\to[n]$，$\\tau:V\\setminus I\\to\\mathbb B$，$G=(V,I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)$；$\\mathrm{BDD}_n$ 见 [[27-df-bdd]]。$\\rho:[n]\\to[n]$ 为双射。下式定义有序 BDD 谓词与使用有限整数顶点编码的有序 BDD 集合。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-bdd|df-bdd — Binary decision diagrams and their evaluation]]"},{"id":"586b77ffc2cf4dd2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$G=(V,I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)$，$\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)$，见 [[27-df-bdd]]。$a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$；$\\mathcal P_1$ 是下节构造的带边标签路径编码族，$P=(v,b)$ 分解为顶点序列和离开边标签序列；$k(P)$ 是下节构造的路径边数。空积等于 $1$。 $\\mathrm{EvalBDD}_n(G)$ 亦见 [[27-df-bdd]]。"}],"outgoing":["d87d01e5686c19fe"]}